  "before_findings": "Unchanged originals: acceptedString C/SAN prints3, Rust rejects method parameter. Broader admitted prototype failed whole-reference stores/reads, indexed argument borrows and owned assignment results; genuine separate before/after retained. Package probes exposed qualified field compound stores and a shared C constructor bug. Acceptedmain72 C and Rust both fail the same record-variable constructor due invalid C; current compiler both clean, so matching earlier failure is not counted as parity.",
