  "scope": "Plain heap-free value-record qualified method arguments, supported stable numeric fields, independent and indexed places and independent RS/RS/C artifacts. Wider effectful compound RHS, aliases, heap-owning record/copy hooks, remaining8SDK modules and final platform/original-corpus/ABI/lifecycle goal remain open.",
